{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_bdrk_ulzwqdc4adzgaizar5d4tjrgh7lq2rtltykqbg5st34y6rdzctxq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All tests pass:\n- 66 tests for `snprintf` module (covering `rpl_vsnprintf`, `rpl_asprintf`, `fmtstr`, `fmtint`, `fmtflt`, `printsep`, `getnumsep`, `getexponent`, `convert`, `cast`, `mypow10`)\n- 32 tests for `xopt` module (covering `xopt_context`, `xopt_parse`, `xopt_autohelp`, all type/flag constants, `XOPT_NULLOPTION`)\n\nThe tests cover both modules listed in `src/lib.rs` (`xopt` and `snprintf`), exercise their public APIs directly, and assert on exact computed values. Edge cases tested include:\n\n**snprintf:**\n- All format specifiers (`%s`, `%d`, `%c`, `%o`, `%x`, `%X`, `%u`, `%f`, `%%`)\n- Width, precision, flags (`-`, `0`, `+`, ` `)\n- Truncation when buffer size is small\n- `%.*s` and `%*d` (variable width/precision)\n- Edge cases for `cast` (negative, exact integers, overflow), `convert` (zero, various bases), `getexponent` (zero, negative, large)\n\n**xopt:**\n- Long and short options (`--name=value`, `-x`)\n- Required/optional/bool argument types\n- Combined short options (`-abc`)\n- `NOCONDENSE`, `SLOPPYSHORTS`, `POSIXMEHARDER`, `KEEPFIRST`, `STRICT` flags\n- Double-dash separator (`--`)\n- Singular dash as extra\n- Invalid options, missing values, type validation errors\n- Hex (`0x`) and octal (`0`) integer parsing\n- Autohelp output formatting\n\nAll tests verified against C ground truth by compiling and running the C source code."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":312,"cache_read_input_tokens":120550,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":312,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ad17ac0-0fb9-4195-a719-c8bd0d489905","uuid":"af07fc1e-a9db-4d42-b72a-16fd7962ea3d"}
